{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：08:53 2026-09-11 HKT<br/>發佈時間：08:53 2026-09-11 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：08:53 2026-09-11 HKT</p><p>紅磡必嘉街92-112號紅磡灣中心地下一間酒家，今（11日）早上約7時，職員報案指酒家門口及招牌均被人淋潑紅油，警員接報到場，將案列刑事毀壞，正調查兇徒動機。</p><img alt=\"紅磡必嘉街92-112號紅磡灣中心地下一間酒家被淋紅油。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/218cdca1b8099ba6c84bea1c4c31ccec/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-11_at_08_35_15_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/61baa6f57fcbca29e5bdc1ec5df5080b/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-11_at_08_35_15.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7d666fbc97529649449d9fcf2a4165f5/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-11_at_08_35_14_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"酒家名亦被淋上紅油。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/467088f6a6244343565d332be6ffe43a/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-11_at_08_35_14.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c830801b2be6d2fe9e8f8c9e38ed67c1/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-11_at_08_35_13_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"門外有閉路電視鏡頭。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/fad1eb01c95cf03ee7695cb28a208b54/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-11_at_08_35_13_1_.jpeg\"/><p>現場所見，酒家門口的招牌、地面均滿佈紅油迹，職員僅表示甚麼都不知道。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-11T01:04:49.891016+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":197,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}